Project: Government Laptop OS Installation & EFI Error Fix


Fixed “Mount EFI System Partition” error on a restricted government-issued laptop.

Used Windows 10 bootable USB (Rufus) to access the repair environment.

Removed restricted partitions and prepared the disk for a clean OS installation.

Used Command Prompt and MBR2GPT to convert the disk from MBR to GPT.

Created the required partitions and completed a clean Windows installation.

Successfully updated the Lenovo BIOS/firmware.

Removed the government boot logo and restored the original Lenovo logo during startup.

